name puyotikz
category Package
revision 57254
shortdesc Quickly typeset board states of Puyo Puyo games
longdesc This LaTeX package permits to quickly typeset board states of
longdesc Puyo Puyo games. It supports large and small boards with
longdesc arbitrary shape, hidden rows, current and next puyos, labels
longdesc and move planning markers. The package requires Python3 in
longdesc support of scripts driven by PythonTeX.
